      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tips, i'll try the clay mask. but honestly it's so deep that i feel like the stuff is actually trapped under a layer of skin. i was thinking if i just took a sterile lancet or even a very fine sewing needle and just made a tiny little opening right on top of it, i could get the plug out way easier. wouldn't that be a much more effective way to get it out since it's so deep? like, is there a specific way to do that without leaving a scar?",
